{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Nap Noise 是一款集合多種自然音效與白噪音的應用程式，專為想放鬆、增強專注、進行冥想或改善睡眠的人士而設。它利用柔和的雨聲、海浪聲、森林環境音與白噪音、粉紅噪音、棕色噪音，營造寧靜氛圍，原價 US $9.99，現在限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>多種自然音效助眠冥想</h2>\n<p>Nap Noise 提供柔和的雨聲、海浪聲、森林環境音，以及白噪音、粉紅噪音和棕色噪音。高品質音效能遮蔽外界干擾，幫助用家更快入睡、延長深層休息；亦可在工作時提升專注與生產力，同時透過平靜環境音強化正念冥想練習。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-269-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-270-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-271-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-272-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-273-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-274-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：粉紅噪音 白噪聲 助眠: Nap Noise 冥想 白噪音</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:21.254095+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}